---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="AI Tool Guru privacy policy">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <article>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Last updated: April 2026</p>

      <h2>Who We Are</h2>
      <p>AI Tool Guru is an independent review site operated by Piceras Group Ltd. We provide honest reviews and recommendations of AI tools for UK small businesses.</p>

      <h2>What Data We Collect</h2>
      <p>We collect minimal data to operate this website:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> We use privacy-focused analytics to understand how visitors use our site. This data is anonymised and does not identify you personally.</li>
        <li><strong>Newsletter:</strong> If you subscribe to our newsletter, we collect your email address. You can unsubscribe at any time.</li>
        <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> We use cookies to remember your theme preference (light/dark mode) and to improve your browsing experience.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Affiliate Links</h2>
      <p>Some links on this site are affiliate links. This means we may earn a commission if you click through and make a purchase. This does not affect the price you pay. We only recommend tools we have tested and believe in.</p>

      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>We may use third-party services for hosting, analytics, and email delivery. These services may collect data in accordance with their own privacy policies.</p>

      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>Under UK data protection law, you have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access the personal data we hold about you</li>
        <li>Request correction of inaccurate data</li>
        <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
        <li>Object to processing of your data</li>
        <li>Request restriction of processing</li>
        <li>Request transfer of your data</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about this privacy policy, please contact us at hello@aitoolguru.co.uk.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</Layout>
